WEBVTT

00:00:00.634 --> 00:00:01.436
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.245 --> 00:00:05.730
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Niamh and Karen were <b>both</b> very excited to meet.

00:00:07.595 --> 00:00:08.361
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:09.265 --> 00:00:11.737
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> The two girls looked <b>identical</b>.

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:14.471
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:15.439 --> 00:00:19.871
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> The first photos Maggie looked at were totally <b>different from</b> her.

00:00:21.902 --> 00:00:22.582
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:23.614 --> 00:00:26.999
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> Maggie found one woman who looked <b>just like</b> her brother.

00:00:29.063 --> 00:00:30.019
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:30.972 --> 00:00:35.111
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Her husband said, ‘She has <b>the same</b> mouth <b>as</b> you.’

00:00:37.086 --> 00:00:38.026
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:38.906 --> 00:00:42.134
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> Maggie’s ‘twin’ looks very <b>similar to</b> her.